{"reviews":[{"id":"B07TK6647L-0","r":5.0,"t":"Good design and powerful wind","x":"I like the rose gold and black design. It looked noble but the price is not high. It is true powerful wind and dries my hair soon -- only within 5 minutes. Besides, the buttons for adjusting low/high temperature or speeds makes it easier to choose the most comfortable way to dry my long hair. A great hairdryer to be recommended!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-1","r":1.0,"t":"Not for thick hair!!!!","x":"I bought this to replace my $10 Walmart blow dryer. Based on the reviews I thought I was getting a great deal. If you have thick hair don\u2019t even bother. I had to switch back before I even finished drying my hair","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-2","r":5.0,"t":"Light weight! Works great! Very pleased!","x":"Best hair dryer ever! I've had many Ah hairdryer in my life. (I love my hair dont judge me) but this one. Man this one is fabulous. The settings are perfect, it's like Goldie Locks hair dryer because it's not too hot but it's just hot enough to dry. Just enough power but doesn't blow my ears off. And its very light weight so when I'm spending an hour drying my hair my arm doesn't break off.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-3","r":4.0,"t":"Not very powerful, but...","x":"I love how lightweight this dryer is. It doesn\u2019t have much power but works for me since I have fairly fine hair. I like that it has three heat settings but can\u2019t figure out who would use the high setting because it\u2019s blistering hot, so unless you\u2019re trying to quickly melt an ice sculpture or shrink wrap a gift basket stick to medium heat or you will fry your hair.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great price great dryer","x":"Very nice blow dryer works great!!! I bought this for my kids I didn't want to spend to much on them in case they dropped it and broke it. However I almost want to trade them dryers I like there's better than my professional blow dryer that I paid a lot for.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great little blow dryer for the price","x":"I needed a blow dryer fast when mine broke. I bought this one because it was affordable and I figured I could buy another one later. I love this little thing. It's small but works just as well as my previous one. Would recommend to anyone who needs a blow dryer but doesn't want to spend a lot of money.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-6","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s not heavy and looks nice","x":"This is not heavy and doesn\u2019t blow hard and the attachments doesn\u2019t like to stay on but it works. I got it for my granddaughters so it\u2019ll be great for them","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-7","r":5.0,"t":"Must Buy!","x":"For the best results, use a round brush. It took no time to dry my hair normally I would have to part my hair in so many sections but only 4 was needed. I love it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-8","r":3.0,"t":"Very large and heavy","x":"This is a very large and heavy dryer.  I am keeping it as I need one right now but would not buy it again.  Hard to handle.  Certainly too large to travel with.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-9","r":1.0,"t":"Not for thick hair","x":"Definitely not for thick hair.. the airflow just isn\u2019t  powerful enough and it takes me almost twice as long to dry my hair compared to my $10 conair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-10","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful design and works great","x":"Great value for what you get. For this price you can pick up a plain looking hair dryer and this has style and it works as expected so might as well wait the couple of days to have this on your door step and ready to go if you don't need the hair dryer immediately. We ordered the white/gold one as well since we have 6 females in this house with varying hair lengths from shoulder to waist line. Nobody likes long wet hair and it will definitely come in handy when the weather goes cold. A good buy ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-11","r":3.0,"t":"Not 1875 watts.","x":"This is a nice little dryer. It however is not 1875 watts as the description says. It\u2019s less powerful than my Revlon 1875 that it\u2019s replacing. Not worth returning as I\u2019ve used it and tossed the packaging but I probably wouldn\u2019t have bought it had I known. That said, it does work and the price is good. I\u2019m not mad just disappointed.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-12","r":5.0,"t":"Nice Dryer","x":"This blow dryer is just what I wanted.  Very light weight, can be very hot on high heat.  I can only handle medium.  Blower speed is perfect also.  I hate when low blows the hair out of the brush.  Not sure why anyone would need more from a blow dryer.  Price is awesome too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-13","r":3.0,"t":"Meh...it's alright","x":"So my old hair dryer broke. So I bought this one for the reviews and I can't say I'm too happy. The blower itself is heavier than some of my other blowerss. The attachment concentrator is not narrow enough. Over I would not buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great value for my money!","x":"Omg this was a great investment and I was surprised how cheap it was. I wasn't expecting what I got at all. Please purchase this hair dryer it's great and even straightens my daughter natural hair without a straightener!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great light-weight dryer","x":"My old dryer broke and I needed a new one quickly that hopefully wouldn\u2019t break the bank. This filled the bill very nicely. Works much better than the old one. I definitely recommend if you are in a bind and need it soon.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great hair dryer","x":"Great hair dryer. The cool down button is good feature and quickly turns hot air cool. Like the handle having a hanging loop built into it, can finally get my hair dryer off my vanity; more counter top space.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-17","r":5.0,"t":"Does the job","x":"I like the drying power and the light weight aspect of this dryer. The size could have been a bit smaller, but that's the least. The head attachment pieces are nice and easy to put on and remove.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-18","r":5.0,"t":"Cool Button in bad spot","x":"I really like the hair dryer except that the cool button is in the spot where you hold the dryer when drying your hair. I constantly have to re adjust my hand so I avoid hitting it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-19","r":5.0,"t":"Quality product","x":"This unit gives my fine hair volume.  Really gentle on my hair too.  Three speeds are a plus.  I am surprised how nice this dryer is for such a reasonable price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-20","r":5.0,"t":"Works well","x":"Love the this blow dryer I read a comment that says doesn\u2019t work good for thick hair but it does I\u2019m AA AND IT does a great job to my hair heats up n 5 secs","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great guest blow dryer","x":"I bought this blow dryer for my guest who come and stay with us.  The price was right for a blow dryer that will only be used a few times a year.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-22","r":1.0,"t":"junk","x":"arrived in black and white generic packaging and caught fire on the first use....  Amazon are you lowering your quality standards???","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-23","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect hair dryer!","x":"Great hair dryer! You can sent it for cool med or hot and 3 different speeds as well. Easy, good size and healthier for your hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07TK6647L-24","r":5.0,"t":"Happy with purchase!","x":"Works great! And I have very think hair! Recommend if you need a new hair dryer and aren\u2019t looking to spend a ton!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find it a great value for the price, praising its affordability and performance relative to cost.","cites":[1,5,6,11,13,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe it as lightweight and easy to handle.","cites":[3,4,7,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it lacks power, especially for thick hair, and some note it is not as powerful as advertised.","cites":[2,4,10,12]},{"text":"Reviewers praise its attractive design and appearance.","cites":[1,7,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the attachments don't stay on well or aren't narrow enough.","cites":[7,14]}]},"qa":[]}